  <item>
    <title>vol.57 旅途回声：端午港澳记忆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a904dcaef65145dfcc67669</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a904dcaef65145dfcc67669</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>内容提要：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">00:26:19</a> 鸽了和乘乘的澳门之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18900">05:15:00</a> 深圳暴雨飞机晚点，凌晨5点到达深圳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42679">11:51:19</a> 端午节香港天桥菲佣放假聚会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64346">17:52:26</a> 在香港就是填饱肚子罢了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74580">20:43:00</a> 道路窄绿化少</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84320">23:25:20</a> 去奢侈品店里长见识了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108442">30:07:22</a> 香港搭乘公交车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131650">36:34:10</a> 澳门的空气都是香香的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143899">39:58:19</a> 会对澳门产生好奇心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154634">42:57:14</a> 荷官都是不说话戴口罩的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166809">46:20:09</a> 澳门少有红绿灯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179707">49:55:07</a> 乘坐了港珠澳大桥</span></p><p><span>香港天桥菲佣放假聚会</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPJcNTxvctNwEnFPliVYGWMqvdE.jpg"><p><span>维港夜景咋一点也不金碧辉煌？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyY_rc0EIyVkPkwbKSQm4gPRaqK.jpg"><p><span>香港地铁的瓜</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FroUPtO-NSMd73-AMeByjkeLp0rM.jpg"><p><span>澳门永利皇宫的音乐喷泉+缆车</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjtEk8GBJiIqe3jP1aEv8O0M9yK.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmxRyEa8H4Vb4EfRaReUm06-7flb.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/lioURiHUBr5n4c2wdX1yovRmtL6X.m4a" length="51195674" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
