  <item>
    <title>vol.54 如果感到幸福你就拍拍手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d7b3cae2c8be3155cc8898</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d7b3cae2c8be3155cc8898</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期要和大家分享最近一些想起来就感到幸福快乐的事情，也欢迎大家在评论区的分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 和同事做饭 吃光光接受彩虹屁的夸奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 因长辈曾经的过节，多年未讲话的姐妹破解尴尬，重新联系和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 六个人一起骑五辆共享单车去公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 收到的意外惊喜：安徽腊肠，又好吃又长脸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 意外组局体验＋1：和朋友吃饭，偶遇朋友的朋友一起玩剧本杀吃饭聊八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">52:17</a> 玩谁是卧底，因小妹妹年龄识字少，出现状况爆笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 痴迷于1688购物，退货还退岔了</span></p><span></span><p><span>老好吃的安徽腊肠：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flnvof8Ui5n3-ZBs6yWmSu8Vgrjh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>谁是卧底：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6CXYhMMmX3Gdb5cQX9-veo201r.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>to 1688：这两件一模一样的裤子到底是哪一家的？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr8o9xIjR9MH_mcbSSEtK5mqlsjy.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/lvkFvzzcCxwgeXJ-LHSGUQ87g4wb.m4a" length="59337264" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
