  <item>
    <title>vol.52 羡慕这个，羡慕那个</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6967c08c109824f9e17ee191</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6967c08c109824f9e17ee191</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 20:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>羡慕但不嫉妒，向往而不迷失。说说我们羡慕过的那些人，欢迎大家在评论区分享自己羡慕的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">1:39</a> 羡慕朋友有一份理想的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">6:22</a> 羡慕同学有一双均匀美丽的腿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">8:32</a> 羡慕不洁癖但是整洁的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 乘乘关于怎样可以进被窝的连环拷问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 羡慕男性高中生可以理所当然的啥也不干不参与家庭活动且被很多人默认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a>“重男轻女”这个词代表这什么？会给我们什么样的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 羡慕可以享受玩手机等快乐但不会自责的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 看书和不看书的人好像没有什么区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 羡慕有时间有爱好有陪伴没有生活压力的老人</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/loWGT-TtFDtYwk5lZE-9OXbRJZhI.m4a" length="59772905" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.51 潮的是衣服更是自信</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69443ca3038062bdbcace560</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69443ca3038062bdbcace560</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>内容介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">0:38</a> 自剪“东京”刘海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">7:41</a> 因为想要卷发不舍得剪头发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 买衣服的点：独特、有质感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a>大学后穿衣风格的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 互联网穿搭教程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 穿上那些不被其他人理解衣服的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 公园里做十个俯卧撑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">50:42</a> 怎么觉得这个人很潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3553">59:13</a> 摇粒绒外套爆改成“黑熊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3631">1:00:31</a> 你不喜欢但是大众比较喜欢的服饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 喇叭裤爆改成“葫芦”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">1:04:32</a> 乐福鞋的评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">1:09:47</a> 穿搭是人的一种自我表达吗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/ljL4FfADBlpTpbIzs9yLjkCuvyJR.m4a" length="71827602" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol50. 学校没教，社会没普及，但是我们都应该懂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693045703fec3166cf1a8ef6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693045703fec3166cf1a8ef6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人的权益到底有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们平常权益被侵犯的时候，是否会认为是自己小题大做？</span></p><span></span><p><span>女儿也有土地继承权？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你认真观察过自己的外y吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>社会对“女团腿”的推崇违背生理构造，臀部大肌群成为全身肌肉MVP？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么中老年人不爱出远门？</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有坚持到最后一刻就是前功尽弃吗？</span></p>]]></description>
