  <item>
    <title>vol.49 人在西湖游，随意随遇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691205ea5acab5990bd981ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691205ea5acab5990bd981ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上有天堂下有苏杭，互联网大厂、美食荒漠、西湖、千岛湖……这是乘乘随心而行的杭州之旅，欢迎大家分享你对杭州的印象。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">1:01</a> 杭州互联网园区、”鸽子笼“逼塞住宿、lofter短租房间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">8:12</a> 在杭州吃的一些连锁店：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;烤匠：烤鱼有点鲜嫩过头、老豆腐、米酿丸子推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;鸡柳大人：炸白果美味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> （哥哥的）深夜食堂性价比还行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 福州园里前，融合菜好好吃！冰镇咕噜肉、咸蛋黄茄子封神了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 牛基地连锁火锅肉好嫩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 在西湖吹风看落日散步很惬意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 西湖免门票、灵隐寺会收费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 寺庙的门票收多少比较合适？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 当请假被领导说请假频繁：）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/ljGf8BmpyTeGnYTLcfBbgyHT9WKF.m4a" length="55361086" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
