  <item>
    <title>vol48.龙岩冠豸山，秋游轻景点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69006480efa5102632fe1a97</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69006480efa5102632fe1a97</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 06:38:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>景区：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>长汀古城</span></strong><span>：小众景点，夜晚凉爽，古城内有表演，如打铁花、歌舞表演等。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>丁屋岭古村</span></strong><span>：千年古村，无蚊环境，古村落原始风貌，村路排水系统良好，雨天不积水。沿途还能欣赏百香果、稻田等自然景观。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>冠豸山</span></strong><span>：五A景区，丹霞地貌，山脉多样，景区内有湖泊可乘船游览，配套索道和扶梯方便登顶。景区的自然与人文介绍详细，让人感受不同地形和生态特色。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>培田古村落：</span></strong><span>福建保存完好的明清客家古村</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小贴士</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>龙岩景点分布广，交通不便，建议量力而行。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小众景点可能没有商业化设施，需提前规划行程。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/lkug4-S1ge3bQ-4929I0MAkMRBk5.m4a" length="22312087" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.47 工作给我们带来了什么？</title>
