  <item>
    <title>vol.46 溜溜过：下颚疼、赶海晒、美食吃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c036942c82c9dcca8b3a40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c036942c82c9dcca8b3a40</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Sep 2025 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>下颚紊乱疼痛溜，蛙泳学会溜，牙齿又不行了溜，赶海滑倒溜，吃好吃溜，生活就这样溜溜过啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">1:44</a> 根管治疗牙齿填充物掉落？牙冠戴上后牙齿还隐隐作痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">8:55</a> 下颚关节紊乱很抓狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 分享蛙泳自学换气的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 有华无实的肌肉和《囚徒健身》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 当好友突然找你玩...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> 大鼎石锅鱼值得一试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 赶海的泥土很有抓力让人新奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 赶海节目之拔鞋子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> 赶海中健步如飞的摔下来+脚底被贝壳划伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3104">51:44</a> 谁把防晒霜用成涂改液的效果啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3254">54:14</a> 晚饭出发匠滋味~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a> 十里长堤听LIVE音乐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsQDzKY_TPCxGMcQMPbVvipsWMAu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liCtQtDROuGgU6ESCS19_DpkAJOC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvODMCo2Dp1Y_gVw6fFVytQcTkn9.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/llPNiWAwadWDp3QT5XxjDNdBxkOO.m4a" length="85333528" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.45 沙县 1 日游: 美食与风景双重享受</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ac1893293471fed4597876</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ac1893293471fed4597876</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目里，扣扣和橙橙带大家一起去沙县 1 日游！</span><br><span>从动车到达开始，我们一路打卡了酸菜牛肉粉、春兰烧麦、金包银、烧饼、仙草冻和甜米酒，晚上则在沙县大食堂吃了一顿烫嘴豆腐、酸辣汤、包馅白果和熏鸭腿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了美食，我们还在沙溪边散步、探访宝元寺和博物馆，最后逛了逛七峰叠翠风景区，有免费的玻璃栈道噢 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你想知道沙县小吃在当地究竟是什么味道，以及沙县的风景和美食哪一个更值得打卡，就跟我们一起边听边聊吧！✨</span></p><span></span><h2><span>⏱ 出发</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:00:30</a></span></strong><span> 同事推荐 + 临时起意，怀着“沙县小吃靠谱吗”的疑问出发</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🥢 美食打卡</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a></span></strong><span> 🍜 原索桥南霞牛肉粉：酸菜牛肉粉不错，但扁肉“科技含量90%”</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a></span></strong><span> 🥟 春兰烧麦：粉丝馅普通，甜烧麦像花生味月饼；辣酱是亮点； 金包银类似炸豆腐包肉馅，口感类似狮子头，卤汁加热更香</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a></span></strong><span> 🥤 柴熬烧仙草：仙草冻 &amp; 甜米酒，仙草里带薄荷，米酒甜度适中但容易发酵</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a></span></strong><span> 沙县大食堂：装修像“南京大排档 Plus”</span><br><span>烫嘴豆腐：汤鲜美，带黄花菜 、海蛏干</span><br><span>酸辣汤：酸爽顺口，鸭血、金针菇</span><br><span>包馅白果：手打口感特别，像青团、饺子粑</span><br><span>熏鸭腿：与武夷山熏鹅各有千秋</span><br><span>拌青菜：平价又新鲜的良心菜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>🌳 下午/傍晚闲逛</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a></span></strong><span> 🏛️ 沙县博物馆：适合避暑休息</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a></span></strong><span> 🌉 七峰叠翠风景区：免费玻璃栈道临溪而建，散步拍照刚好</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span>💰 总结 &amp; 花销</span></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a></span></strong><span> 💸 人均花费 150 元（动车票 90 + 吃喝 60）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a></span></strong><span> 📝 感受</span><br><span>扣扣：性价比超高，吃得开心</span><br><span>乘乘：风景与美食相得益彰</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/lhEc7bI0P5AjA2auDK-mJAsWatdu.m4a" length="39825207" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.44 又苟住了一个夏天的小命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689b6c09032793b18a157638</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689b6c09032793b18a157638</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 16:38:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天夏天悄悄过去留下小秘密，热着工作着真呀真辛苦，欢迎大家在评论区分享你们的夏日体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 以前初中住宿只有两个旋转风扇的夏天是咋睡着的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 夏天、冬天二选一？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 爷爷不泡茶之白桃黄皮冰 好喝到自己煮黄皮果水喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 夏日自制饮品之网上经常推送的苹果水：苹果、红枣等煮开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 夏日自制饮品之煮橄榄水、银耳炖梨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 原来不是所有人都喜欢游泳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1623">27:03</a> 哪个公司一到下班点就自动关空调啊，那你倒是让我也下班别加班啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 农村给晶不是苟命而是好好生活的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 洗乳贴方法推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>抠抠的户外录制现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgcBM21UPnX0hFY8bAbaeF_w4fFJ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/ljh-DZzNr1ipY8dj09qufSxH-gSI.m4a" length="42323313" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI7ijSqG1t8CAtph_j86ZxzHhQJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol43 友情也要用力经营，我们聊了聊彼此的“小动作”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688797c58e06fe8de72564f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688797c58e06fe8de72564f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>周二早上好呀！打开这期来轻松一下~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们聊了聊从小学、初中、大学到工作，我们的朋友圈都发生了哪些变化？</span><br><span>聊着聊着就从「现在靠微信语音维系友情」到[煲电话粥聊八卦最有劲]。那些我们各自在友情里偷偷努力的小动作：比如主动打电话、分享八卦、挽着手臂走街逛巷、假装不在意但其实很介意、被放鸽子之后还要装作没事人、如何像对待爱情般经营友谊……😂</span></p><span></span><p><span>👯‍♀️ 如果你也有类似的友情心事，这期一定会让你会心一笑，</span><br><span>👀 如果你是我们的朋友，看看你有没有中招！</span><br><span>🫶 如果你也有那种会打很久电话的朋友，一定要把这期分享给ta！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/652ac4971568da8cef2e06e0/liFCFHlI6ZkTqWfjlKpF8LQzG5Yy.m4a" length="45907669" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:18</itunes:duration>
